WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:14.193
The Investigation Board maps foreign influence operations inside Canadian politics using exclusively public government records — Hansard transcripts, Lobbying Commissioner filings, Elections Canada data, RCMP reports, and Auditor General findings.

00:00:14.193 --> 00:00:19.556
Entities are clustered by frequency of interaction and weighted by co-occurrence in official records.

00:00:19.556 --> 00:00:26.204
Every node, every connection, every line on this board traces to a document the government itself published.

00:00:26.204 --> 00:00:28.977
Zero speculation — all sourced.
